# A result of a kind sego doesn't select is counted in a note and not printed.
args: search 'repo:sego-fake/unknown foo'
exit: 0
--- stdout
1 match  1 repo  0.1 s, deadline 60 s
query  repo:sego-fake/unknown foo count:100  (count:100 added by sego)
--- stderr
sego: note: 1 result of kind Weird not shown
